  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I have been reading a little book called How to Write for the Press.",
      "output_sha256": "192fbd16cf549ba1e5c45e4d53641f45164eabe2aa24bed26ab3565bf0324116",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "192fbd16cf549ba1e5c45e4d53641f45164eabe2aa24bed26ab3565bf0324116",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Other books which have been published upon the same subject are How to Be an Author, How to Write a Play, How to Succeed as a Journalist, How to Write for the Magazines, and How to Earn £600 a Year with the Pen.",
      "output_sha256": "d9428a24c9e26cd780a1423c1cb87138ddb09df9dd61476d9948c63ad7859089",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "d9428a24c9e26cd780a1423c1cb87138ddb09df9dd61476d9948c63ad7859089",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Of these the last-named has, I think, the most pleasing title.",
      "output_sha256": "3e4449f2f3f350c1a5744c1adb7712611b6826596b5f78d255d67ae07fcf5502",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "3e4449f2f3f350c1a5744c1adb7712611b6826596b5f78d255d67ae07fcf5502",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It seems anyone can write a play; the real challenge lies in getting it staged.",
      "output_sha256": "a64ff54698c7fef7192e00c4fe0e64d1f5468a552817a7252e5f0543f55b3110",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.424286,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7b1e3a434dbba90b3fb069549ca406f8a6a09a82eccb2e811f727fb451447f9e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a64ff54698c7fef7192e00c4fe0e64d1f5468a552817a7252e5f0543f55b3110",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Almost anybody can be an author; the business is to collect money and fame from this state of being.",
      "output_sha256": "e207323f43cff954433e074f31bf35ff3f665d3a0c39ad93df139973fc0d7df0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "e207323f43cff954433e074f31bf35ff3f665d3a0c39ad93df139973fc0d7df0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Writing for the magazines, again, sounds a delightful occupation, but literally it means nothing without the co- operation of the editors of the magazines, and it is this co- operation which is so difficult to secure.",
      "output_sha256": "879b41552b7e6d5ba8fbaf89d23193bef59a40f79302610cd35b2f81c0ed846a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "879b41552b7e6d5ba8fbaf89d23193bef59a40f79302610cd35b2f81c0ed846a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But to earn £600 a year with the pen is to do a definite thing; if the book could really tell the secret of that, it would have an enormous sale.",
      "output_sha256": "e06bdc6cdc90958a1f115a034810530be2524dd9f9cc0e5fb17e741f67f8a5c3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "e06bdc6cdc90958a1f115a034810530be2524dd9f9cc0e5fb17e741f67f8a5c3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "However, as I haven't read it, I can't comment on its contents—perhaps it merely serves as a guide to forgery.",
      "output_sha256": "a80cb9c150a5797f7631a3b10b734df202f0bdec1201c7b5bc61fdf90828205f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.42437,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8,
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1e0b30a310ff6570841ac4236243bec1a4e54904106aaff7d640787f7f709948",
        "7d4712e9f582e176a6b902502cc29389b519db0d00276eae81b1eb339a85097a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a80cb9c150a5797f7631a3b10b734df202f0bdec1201c7b5bc61fdf90828205f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "My experience with How to Write for the Press was somewhat disappointing.",
      "output_sha256": "ca4d1f66aaf72d42189f3807eba20c2b376839a7d67ecd82eed3f94defb6126c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.569405,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c5f99c93edbe638485283e5cefb883247d35b943d7499cced5519b64fa1660fe"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ca4d1f66aaf72d42189f3807eba20c2b376839a7d67ecd82eed3f94defb6126c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is concerned not with the literary journalist (as I believe he is called) but with the reporter (as he is never called, the proper title being \"special representative\").",
      "output_sha256": "40fb533d45fc4170acc26095283987413b5750b0792c219fbfd4e6a63a9353ef",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "40fb533d45fc4170acc26095283987413b5750b0792c219fbfd4e6a63a9353ef",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It gives in tabular form a list of the facts you should ascertain at the different functions you attend; with this book in your pocket there would be no excuse if you neglected to find out at a wedding the names of the bride and bridegroom.",
      "output_sha256": "e60dde6c3b4b63dae6869b6bf02e3b92400358b371fb055cccf3e5ab68e0462b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "e60dde6c3b4b63dae6869b6bf02e3b92400358b371fb055cccf3e5ab68e0462b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Additionally, it offers a list of synonyms for common subjects of description, which I find to be quite generous.",
      "output_sha256": "d2e9c62f193a3d8bf5a4085f64a1b664c6ef576738f757403ae14f127313f02a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.389312,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "12e36a0c7f68238f01895dbd6f497fb60091dfb9e2776c248313195e66f1ddc5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d2e9c62f193a3d8bf5a4085f64a1b664c6ef576738f757403ae14f127313f02a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The danger of calling the protagonists at the court of Hymen (this one is not from the book; I thought of it myself just now)—the danger of calling them \"the happy pair\" more than once in a column is that your readers begin to suspect that you are a person of extremely limited mind, and when once they get this idea into their heads they are not in a proper state to appreciate the rest of your article.",
      "output_sha256": "ead7f8cbcbfb7ba27aa124f5bb10c8c381b6ae214020adf340f6025110d1610f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "ead7f8cbcbfb7ba27aa124f5bb10c8c381b6ae214020adf340f6025110d1610f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But if in your second paragraph you speak of \"the joyful couple,\" and in your third of \"the ecstatic brace,\" you give an impression of careless mystery of the language which can never be shed away.",
      "output_sha256": "3ead2afe16ac9b6c6211089e44151a5d9bf22a3fc0c9d018d3d110845f507d36",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "3ead2afe16ac9b6c6211089e44151a5d9bf22a3fc0c9d018d3d110845f507d36",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Among the many interesting chapters is one dealing with contested elections.",
      "output_sha256": "a8fcb0b81c2fbf0faa7d67b52314558a5a0e1832f6aa81b495dea4412721bfea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "a8fcb0b81c2fbf0faa7d67b52314558a5a0e1832f6aa81b495dea4412721bfea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "One piece of advice provided to the special representative is to identify which external organizations are actively involved in the contest.",
      "output_sha256": "fa5c7b97bc5e78dd3262679982f56586d057ac8fcc4b9fea6daede93ed034872",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": 0.441351,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f64960b8ff40639d34d69923403b4673abdb97a84023757ebb6cbcd34fe21434"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fa5c7b97bc5e78dd3262679982f56586d057ac8fcc4b9fea6daede93ed034872",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "In the past, when times were less savory, one might have pointed to the presence of dead cats as a significant outside influence.",
      "output_sha256": "69fef22a6b320d88b691dc8e1eb0d2f1733b6a3c45ee899a6da90a98e5291af2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.259993,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3fef390469ec5990b9c26498c25fd6ad87dd094afb134782a66c7799b4eabc9e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "69fef22a6b320d88b691dc8e1eb0d2f1733b6a3c45ee899a6da90a98e5291af2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Nowadays, I suppose, he is only meant to concern himself with such bodies as the Coal Consumers' League and the Tariff Reform League, and there would be no doubt in the mind of anybody as to whether they were there or not.",
      "output_sha256": "36480d72dd4061801392d13c5470cca9606d0965b6154b54d1ab6ddb61d07e52",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "36480d72dd4061801392d13c5470cca9606d0965b6154b54d1ab6ddb61d07e52",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I am afraid I should not be a success as \"our special representative.\"",
      "output_sha256": "f3ff8b0383b218d64bae267456d7230e31a9b98e37217eb07ec9757a184227a2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "f3ff8b0383b218d64bae267456d7230e31a9b98e37217eb07ec9757a184227a2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I should never think of half the things which occur to the good reporter.",
      "output_sha256": "d662ff031b66e58536b91ebea21f26577afb4bfeb20ccc172bf07a10c1d8a68d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "d662ff031b66e58536b91ebea21f26577afb4bfeb20ccc172bf07a10c1d8a68d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "When reading a local paper, you might encounter a sentence like this: \"The bride's brother, who only arrived last week from Australia, where he held an important position under the Government, and is about to embark on a tour through Canada with—curiously enough—a nephew of the bridegroom, gave her away.\"",
      "output_sha256": "3f042dfcb002be63fd2071da7bc80ff9fd650120de3a784faac801d9f19b79e8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.813386,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "debd7a062466ef7a30848cee73d78246803188af039e4d35b99007046e0b321c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3f042dfcb002be63fd2071da7bc80ff9fd650120de3a784faac801d9f19b79e8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Well, what a mass of information has to be gleaned before that sentence can be written.",
      "output_sha256": "2f85459a24bdf495835627bbc07ebf5d44552ba7faed9213a0b1c1a906348283",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "2f85459a24bdf495835627bbc07ebf5d44552ba7faed9213a0b1c1a906348283",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Or consider this: \"The hall was packed to suffocation, and beneath the glare of the electric light—specially installed for this occasion by Messrs.",
      "output_sha256": "bfd0980816c478400960b79b89d7b49feafa055e6109ad55058e71bb2c660f1a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.957092,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24,
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2bb84a8b34520106b28968fb25b1d14733285233c1ae370b40781d668f526a93",
        "22e1dceb8fcaebe67205a0afbb5605f4b8fa5c3515cb33dbd398e92a91d5a42c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bfd0980816c478400960b79b89d7b49feafa055e6109ad55058e71bb2c660f1a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Ampère & Son of Pumpton, the building being at ordinary times strikingly deficient in the matter of artificial lighting in spite of the efforts of the more progressive members of the town council—the faces of not a few of the fairer sex could be observed.\"",
      "output_sha256": "07c9d210fd0e8db27133b0684c49fd8934f75665036790a08761ed5322586914",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "07c9d210fd0e8db27133b0684c49fd8934f75665036790a08761ed5322586914",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "You know, I am afraid I should have forgotten all that.",
      "output_sha256": "8a7ff73a3335815316c70fef08183f0c46b664fc9c5c2585e3d12edb7f2d6e99",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "8a7ff73a3335815316c70fef08183f0c46b664fc9c5c2585e3d12edb7f2d6e99",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I should simply have obtained a copy of the principal speech, and prefaced it with the words,\" Mr. Dodberry then spoke as follows\"; or, if my conscience would not allow of such a palpable misstatement, \"Mr. Dodberry then rose with the intention of speaking as follows.\"",
      "output_sha256": "7028cfc87226f674d2ca843fca546acfcaf54e0bfb63d6e62483ffbe733c5fc0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "7028cfc87226f674d2ca843fca546acfcaf54e0bfb63d6e62483ffbe733c5fc0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "In the more personal and nuanced craft of interviewing, I would find myself equally lacking.",
      "output_sha256": "45cd7c4cbfeb5b231013aaeda5a28a616ff9ec0305c6c104b10c189c397720f3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": 0.512619,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f877dc4dc40a85e21daa23d6cfaec42d493340b2e0563a5bdb15d67d93623187"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_ai_sha256": "45cd7c4cbfeb5b231013aaeda5a28a616ff9ec0305c6c104b10c189c397720f3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The interview itself would be satisfactory, but I am afraid that its publication would lead people to believe that all the best things had been said by me.",
      "output_sha256": "822b98acf0db91721d03b0f2dcacca007a1a0d54bc93f99a73702b2fe007199e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "822b98acf0db91721d03b0f2dcacca007a1a0d54bc93f99a73702b2fe007199e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Remembering what others have said is relatively straightforward; however, recalling my own remarks shortly after an argument at the club can be quite a challenge.",
      "output_sha256": "8606b70df07f8efeab0a0b6231181cd13403c84072c12d6013e2de1a17079a4e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.291143,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b71a20f67543a9f516cda30a60d36f9e0763df78709874982a73c4f99889ae4b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8606b70df07f8efeab0a0b6231181cd13403c84072c12d6013e2de1a17079a4e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "For to recall YOUR remarks in our argument at the club last night is simply a matter of memory; to recall MINE, I have to forget all that I meant to have said, all that I ought to have said, and all that I have thought upon the subject since.",
      "output_sha256": "db9bb6a72140cdcc22dcf979401693fd8fb76c02a303c941b7932eb02aebd882",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "db9bb6a72140cdcc22dcf979401693fd8fb76c02a303c941b7932eb02aebd882",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "In fact, I begin to see that the successful reporter must eliminate his personality altogether, whereas the successful literary journalist depends for his success entirely upon his personality —which is what is meant by \"style.\"",
      "output_sha256": "e1224f25744183f9649764ae5745118ca6485b42a162e6e3cbaaa1389ec496fb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "e1224f25744183f9649764ae5745118ca6485b42a162e6e3cbaaa1389ec496fb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I suppose it is for this reason that, when the literary journalist is sent as \"our extra-special representative\" to report a prize fight or a final cup tie or a political meeting, the result is always appalling.",
      "output_sha256": "9f92786fb6f9e19c8d27e5d7538265803f252b78cffd82e1d4d78c02258ef657",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "9f92786fb6f9e19c8d27e5d7538265803f252b78cffd82e1d4d78c02258ef657",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The writer's ego often overwhelms the narrative, as it strives to ensure that its unique voice is not overshadowed by the significance of the event.",
      "output_sha256": "eb67048925c2877d22f3f110aba98e11b947c953dcc3a7951e681525d462b304",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.402525,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5498a51a7743b6af31ef9d5fb694809d5a7559e7c2ada760ac3b10e04cebe60d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_ai_sha256": "eb67048925c2877d22f3f110aba98e11b947c953dcc3a7951e681525d462b304",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And those who are more interested in the matter than in the manner regard him as an intruder, and the others regret that he is so greatly overtaxing his strength.",
      "output_sha256": "f6cdf8da4f73d89b3ad9ecd456bb84ec36ffd1d60afe89b2af6702893b9e0527",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "f6cdf8da4f73d89b3ad9ecd456bb84ec36ffd1d60afe89b2af6702893b9e0527",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "So each to his business, and his handbook to each—How to Write for the Press to the special representative, and How to Be an Author to the author.",
      "output_sha256": "c338c53c5e64e407f3a35a57fdfa196d853066e76333bce9e52fd6a050d79d73",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "c338c53c5e64e407f3a35a57fdfa196d853066e76333bce9e52fd6a050d79d73",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I do not believe there exists a book titled How to Be a Solicitor, or a doctor, an admiral, or a brewer.",
      "output_sha256": "1b8b90b9ff97cec85c434e3822d11d58141f31c8a6283c90e17fecdae88a07b4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": 0.717363,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bcf755cd9d665c46aa4fb3c17ed49c7e676f05d7a7fb9e679f93a67d9bd8d7c6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1b8b90b9ff97cec85c434e3822d11d58141f31c8a6283c90e17fecdae88a07b4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "That is a different matter altogether; but any fool can write for the papers.",
      "output_sha256": "e85d96b12797bae437e59dbcc834a1dd13ae7ee3abf2b8cb98944792bccb49f6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
